[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Conquest of Inasta</h2>
<i>"Those blessed with leadership, power, and the faith of the people are truly devastating enemies (and remarkable allies)."<br>
-- High Priest of the Water Kingdom of Trinist</i>

<p> In a struggle for more power, you and your followers advance towards the Kingdom of Inasta where a group of rebels are already attacking the stronghold. Aid the rebels and conquer Inasta.


$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success at Inasta!</h2>
<p>You and your people celebrate a glorious victory at the stronghold of Inasta. More rebels join your cause and bring with them new technology. You find a sudden need for storm power, and look towards the Isles of the Golden Sun.

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,1


[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>Your ally has fallen!</h2>
<p>The leader of the allied rebels has fallen! Looks like you're on your own from here.

[Failed]
<h2>Death...</h2>
<p>
Your enemies are successful in crushing your army. Your head is now an ornament on the wall of the Furies' Fortress.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]